# MASTER PROJECT PROMPT: Build a Complete Production-Ready Backend for Post Composer

## 1. Project Context

I have an existing frontend application called **Post Composer — Social Media Studio**.

Frontend repository:
https://github.com/Meehul05/PostComposer_Frontend

Your task is to independently analyze this frontend repository and develop a complete, production-oriented backend that integrates with it.

**Important constraints:**
- You will receive access to the frontend repository only.
- You will NOT receive an existing backend repository or backend source code.
- You must independently design and implement the entire backend.
- Do not assume that an API, database, authentication system, or backend already exists.
- Do not rebuild, redesign, or unnecessarily modify the frontend.
- The existing frontend is the source of truth for application features, screens, workflows, data structures, and user interactions.
- The backend must be compatible with the actual frontend implementation, not an imagined frontend.

The final result should be a fully functional, secure, maintainable, deployable full-stack application.

