The production mode must not silently fall back to simulated publishing.

Store external account connections against the authenticated user.

Encrypt access tokens and refresh tokens at rest using AES-GCM, with encryption keys supplied through environment variables or a secure secret-management mechanism.

Never expose these tokens to the frontend.

